Requirements
  - NVIDIA GPU with a recent driver
  - CUDA Toolkit 11.6 or newer (nvcc)
  - GCC 9 or newer (C++17), make, curl

Linux / Google Colab / Kaggle
  1. git clone https://github.com/jvignesh072008-ship-it/CUDA-Sobel-Edge-Detection.git
  2. cd CUDA-Sobel-Edge-Detection
  3. make ARCH=sm_75        # sm_75 = T4, sm_60 = P100, sm_80 = A100
  4. chmod +x run.sh
  5. ./run.sh data output 16

Windows
  Use Google Colab or Kaggle, or WSL2 with the CUDA toolkit and follow the
  Linux steps.
